","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Carstanjen","x":"We believe that ticketing revenue from the Starting Gate Pavilion and Courtyard and from other recent investments as well as general price increases will provide meaningful adjusted EBITDA growth for Derby Week going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/churchill-downs-chdn-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHDN 2025 Q4","e":"chdn","d":"2026-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William C. Carstanjen","x":"Despite facing a challenging comparison and economic uncertainty early in 2025, including tariff-related volatility during the later part of our sales cycle, our team executed exceptionally well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/churchill-downs-chdn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHDN 2025 Q4","e":"chdn","d":"2026-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William C. Carstanjen","x":"I think last year, we were thrown off our game slightly because this is about when the tariffs were first introduced, and it disrupted our sales process for a period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/churchill-downs-chdn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHDN 2026 Q3","e":"chdn","d":"2026-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"William C. Carstanjen","x":"We continue to expand its reach and engagement through product innovation and broader direct-to-consumer and business-to-business distribution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/churchill-downs-chdn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHDN 2026 Q3","e":"chdn","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"William C. Carstanjen","x":"So generally, because we've seen such ability to drive pricing power over time, when we do a project at Churchill Downs Racetrack, we're willing to accept a little longer payback time frame than on other assets we develop in the company, say, 